(6203161, 915631, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The shadows seem very long for mid-day, but I giving the benefit of the doubt, because the light is definitely harsh. Nicely done, and I like the lens flare.</td>', 'Beautiful image. The shadows seem very long for mid-day, but I giving the benefit of the doubt, because the light is definitely harsh. Nicely done, and I like the lens flare.', '2010-10-27 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
