(6203578, 916414, 83313, '<td valign="top">If that blown area in the sky is the sun, it looks rather low for midday. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, however. This has been a tough challenge for all.</td>', 'If that blown area in the sky is the sun, it looks rather low for midday. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, however. This has been a tough challenge for all.', '2010-10-28 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
