(6204710, 916210, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nice thought for the challenge. Something that''s interesting to me is that my eyes are drawn first to the bright green in the lower half. Then I notice this is out of focus, so my eyes search to find the appropriate focus spot. For this reason, I''m feeling that the composition of this photo isn''t quite as strong as it could be.</td>', 'Definitely a nice thought for the challenge. Something that''s interesting to me is that my eyes are drawn first to the bright green in the lower half. Then I notice this is out of focus, so my eyes search to find the appropriate focus spot. For this reason, I''m feeling that the composition of this photo isn''t quite as strong as it could be.', '2010-10-29 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204711, 916262, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a good use of the mid day sun. The rays of light really add to the intensity. I wonder if you could have brought up the contrast a bit on this to give this a bit less of the washed out look.</td>', 'This is a good use of the mid day sun. The rays of light really add to the intensity. I wonder if you could have brought up the contrast a bit on this to give this a bit less of the washed out look.', '2010-10-29 22:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204713, 916478, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the sunlight to add reflections and interest to the boats.</td>', 'Nice use of the sunlight to add reflections and interest to the boats.', '2010-10-29 22:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204714, 916414, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, and one of the few times where I like the letterbox style border.</td>', 'Nice scene, and one of the few times where I like the letterbox style border.', '2010-10-29 22:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204715, 915717, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a very difficult scene to make look nice in this type of light. You have a good use of S-curves with the path, and a nice amount of colors. I wonder if you could have brought out a bit more detail in the shadows to mellow out the bright/dark spots a bit more.</td>', 'Definitely a very difficult scene to make look nice in this type of light. You have a good use of S-curves with the path, and a nice amount of colors. I wonder if you could have brought out a bit more detail in the shadows to mellow out the bright/dark spots a bit more.', '2010-10-29 22:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204716, 916084, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ha, I really like the "pose." Great use of depth of field and very good details here.</td>', 'Ha, I really like the "pose." Great use of depth of field and very good details here.', '2010-10-29 22:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204717, 915615, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea behind this, especially with the pond in there. Unfortunately, I''m getting the feeling that this photo is suffering from lack of identity. It feels like you should either bring out details in the shadows, or turn down the shadows to give it a more silhouette feel.</td>', 'I really like the idea behind this, especially with the pond in there. Unfortunately, I''m getting the feeling that this photo is suffering from lack of identity. It feels like you should either bring out details in the shadows, or turn down the shadows to give it a more silhouette feel.', '2010-10-29 22:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204718, 915781, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great combination of light and scene. Very cool framing, and the high key black and white was a good choice.</td>', 'Great combination of light and scene. Very cool framing, and the high key black and white was a good choice.', '2010-10-29 22:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204719, 916322, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and details. I bet you wish this was an advanced editing challenge, as this would be a perfect scene to use HDR techniques.</td>', 'Very nice composition and details. I bet you wish this was an advanced editing challenge, as this would be a perfect scene to use HDR techniques.', '2010-10-29 22:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204720, 916331, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. I think it would have been helpful if the person with the blue shirt was cropped out, and if the grass wasn''t so neon green (it hurts the eyes!)</td>', 'Interesting capture. I think it would have been helpful if the person with the blue shirt was cropped out, and if the grass wasn''t so neon green (it hurts the eyes!)', '2010-10-29 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204721, 916498, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of blurriness to add interest to this scene. It gives a sense of motion, instead of simply obscuring the view.</td>', 'Great use of blurriness to add interest to this scene. It gives a sense of motion, instead of simply obscuring the view.', '2010-10-29 22:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204722, 916004, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, and great use of depth of filed. It''s lucky that she just stepped into the light for you.</td>', 'Cute photo, and great use of depth of filed. It''s lucky that she just stepped into the light for you.', '2010-10-29 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6204724, 916199, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the photo overall. Good scene, neat use of light, and nice use of lines. However, the very high amount of noise is really putting off to me.</td>', 'I like the photo overall. Good scene, neat use of light, and nice use of lines. However, the very high amount of noise is really putting off to me.', '2010-10-29 22:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
