(6205815, 916246, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really wish you didn''t cut off her feet, it looks more accidental than on purpose. It''s a great shot, but the feet are distracting. -7-</td>', 'I really wish you didn''t cut off her feet, it looks more accidental than on purpose. It''s a great shot, but the feet are distracting. -7-', '2010-10-31 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
