(6208951, 916420, 120171, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot makes it difficult see how this fits the challenge, this could have been taken at pretty much anytime.</td>', 'The angle of the shot makes it difficult see how this fits the challenge, this could have been taken at pretty much anytime.', '2010-11-02 16:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209060, 915457, 3746, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this on the frontpage.. great shot.</td>', 'I expect to see this on the frontpage.. great shot.', '2010-11-02 19:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209130, 916111, 10785, '<td valign="top">I admire that you got the couple to pose in the water... Pretty daring of them! I am assuming this is a trash the dress session. While the water pose makes this more dynamic as a picture, the photo itself lacks color and seems a tad under exposed. The sun gives great light yet it doesn''t give off the warmth needed to overcome the blue/grey waters. My eye continuously travels to the negative space in the top of the picture.</td>', 'I admire that you got the couple to pose in the water... Pretty daring of them! I am assuming this is a trash the dress session. While the water pose makes this more dynamic as a picture, the photo itself lacks color and seems a tad under exposed. The sun gives great light yet it doesn''t give off the warmth needed to overcome the blue/grey waters. My eye continuously travels to the negative space in the top of the picture.', '2010-11-02 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209135, 916004, 10785, '<td valign="top">With the dappled sun poking through the leaves of the forest creating a very uneven lighting, you really nailed the exposure. I love that you got the deer in a bright spot, making that a point that my eyes are drawn to. Also the depth of field is pretty awesom givving the photo a very whimsical feel! (Oh, and I just peeked at the title and there it is... whimsical!)</td>', 'With the dappled sun poking through the leaves of the forest creating a very uneven lighting, you really nailed the exposure. I love that you got the deer in a bright spot, making that a point that my eyes are drawn to. Also the depth of field is pretty awesom givving the photo a very whimsical feel! (Oh, and I just peeked at the title and there it is... whimsical!)', '2010-11-02 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209138, 916420, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the point of the challenge was to use direct harsh sunlight and here you have used the shade of the building. That is certainly a technique to overcome the harsh light at noon, but I think it missed the point of te challenge, which was to battle the harsh light when you had no choice but to shoot in it.</td>', 'I think the point of the challenge was to use direct harsh sunlight and here you have used the shade of the building. That is certainly a technique to overcome the harsh light at noon, but I think it missed the point of te challenge, which was to battle the harsh light when you had no choice but to shoot in it.', '2010-11-02 20:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209214, 915457, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth of this image.  Very nice.</td>', 'I really like the depth of this image.  Very nice.', '2010-11-02 21:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6209215, 916481, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  One of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  One of my favorites of the challenge.', '2010-11-02 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
