(6209424, 915577, 108069, '<td valign="top">Jesus? That''s my guess by the cross that appears to be shining on the flag. looking forward to the answer.</td>', 'Jesus? That''s my guess by the cross that appears to be shining on the flag. looking forward to the answer.', '2010-11-02 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
