(6210315, 916481, 33736, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on such a wonderful and spectacular shot, and on your Second Place.  I have to laugh, though - Shots of the South Haven LH have been winning all over the place this past week.  The October 26, 2010 storm was the strongest ever recorded on the Great Lakes, even surpassing that which sunk the Edmund Fitzgerald in 1975.  You are truly one of the dedicated photographers!</td>', 'Congratulations on such a wonderful and spectacular shot, and on your Second Place.  I have to laugh, though - Shots of the South Haven LH have been winning all over the place this past week.  The October 26, 2010 storm was the strongest ever recorded on the Great Lakes, even surpassing that which sunk the Edmund Fitzgerald in 1975.  You are truly one of the dedicated photographers!', '2010-11-03 13:27:41.000000', NULL, 0),
